message: >-
  Cite the software DOI when using code or workflows, the corresponding
  dataset DOI when using experimental data, and both when both are used.
title: Pipe Stress Sensing Benchmark & Data Platform
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gao
    given-names: Bin
    affiliation: University of Electronic Science and Technology of China (UESTC)
abstract: >-
  A traceable research platform for real P110 magnetic-strain and 406-mm
  MEM-remanence-eddy-current pull-test data, with reproducible Python and
  MATLAB workflows, explicit quality-control provenance and conservative
  stress-assessment claim limits.
